sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgba(21,101,192,0.04) Internal zone
    participant W as Engine worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (pre_instance, pre_compensation_stack, pre_timer)
    participant H as Compensate handlers (host)
  end

  Note over W,DB: Forward path: each TX2 of a step with a compensate handler pushes (step, attemptId, handler, input snapshot) onto the stack
  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
    Note over W,DB: TX: start compensation
    W->>DB: notify-partner fails, retries exhausted, onFailure compensate
    W->>DB: instance COMPENSATING, event processes.compensation.started.v1, job for top of stack, COMMIT
  end
  loop each stack entry, newest first (LIFO)
    alt handler is a bean method
      Note over W,H: Async Wait-State: TX1 claim with lease, call, TX2
      rect rgba(243,229,245,0.7)
        W->>H: closeAccount(instanceId, stepId, attemptId)
      end
      alt handler succeeds
        W->>DB: history row, pop entry, token COMPENSATED, job for next entry, COMMIT
      else handler fails after its retries
        W->>DB: pre_incident OPEN, walk paused until retry or resolve
      end
    else compensate manual
      W->>DB: pre_incident COMPENSATION_MANUAL_REQUIRED, walk paused until resolved
    end
  end
  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
    Note over W,DB: TX: finish
    W->>DB: stack empty: instance FAILED (compensated), event processes.instance.failed.v1, COMMIT
  end
